            "text": "<p>Smaller items are shipped via Fedex International Ground, door to door. Items to be shipped via Fedex are subject to customs fees and VAT, which will be included upon checkout. All small parcels are shipped following DDP terms.</p>",
            "url_text": "",
            "btn_text": "",
            "url_link": "",
            "arrow": "false"
          }
        },
        "question_8WFQ7z": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How are container prices determined?",
            "text": "<p>Container prices are automatically calculated based on the port of destination and the number of crates or containers. For reference on the pricing, click here.</p>",
            "url_text": "See references on pricing",
            "btn_text": "",
            "url_link": "#pricing-reference",
            "arrow": "false"
          }
        },
        "question_bHBE4X": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What terms do you provide quotations for?",
            "text": "<p>Our website provides a quotation for CIF terms to the largest port in the country of destination. </p><p>Should you prefer DDP or EXW terms, please contact us to receive a custom quotation.</p>",
            "url_text": "",
            "btn_text": "Contact us",
            "url_link": "shopify://pages/contact",
            "arrow": "false"
          }
        },
        "question_tzU9jQ": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Differences among CIF, DDP, and EXW terms",
            "text": "<p><strong>CIF contract</strong> - The price covers transportation to the largest port in your country, and all fees associated with getting it to the largest port in your country. However, all fees after the arrival to the destination port are the customer’s responsibility. The customer is responsible for: (1) customs duties and taxes, (2) arranging and paying for transportation from the port to the final destination, and (3) destination port fees.</p><p><strong>DDP contract</strong> - Customs duties and taxes are factored into the equipment's total price. The seller is accountable for arranging and paying for transportation until they reach the destination, and they bear responsibility until the product is delivered to the agreed-upon location.</p><p><strong>EXW contract</strong> - The customer is responsible for picking up the item/s from our warehouse, coordinating with couriers, and all customs duties, taxes, port charges, and other fees that may be incurred to reach the point of destination.</p>",
            "url_text": "",
            "btn_text": "",
            "url_link": "",
            "arrow": "false"
          }
        }
      },
