            "title2": "International Warranties",
            "show_contact": false,
            "text": "",
            "richtext": "",
            "list_items": "Warranties for international purchases are for parts only. <b>Labor is not included.</b>;\nTechnicians will be available through phone, chat, or email to walk you through troubleshooting the issue or installing parts that need to be replaced.;Fitness Superstore will cover all shipping charges related to warrantied parts.;All remanufactured items will include a 1 year parts warranty, along with the option of purchasing an extended parts warranty of 2, 3, 4, or 5 years. You may select your preferred option in the “Parts & Labor Warranty” drop down to view the pricing.;French Fitness products, which are all sold brand new, include a 3 year parts warranty. <b>Labor is not included.</b>;\nOther brand new products will include the manufacturer’s warranty, which may or may not be valid for items shipped outside the USA.",
